9ab4fe10-19d9-4138-857a-a62d2b35020a	qd0fySr8W5	Gateway ip 주소 도메인으로 변경	\\\n\n:::info\n현재 Controller, Gateway 에서 사용하는 각 장비의 네트워크 주소는 IP 주소 입니다. \\nDomain 주소로는 설정할 수 없습니다. \n\n:::\n\nController 서버의 DB에 직접 접속하여 데이터를 변경 \n\n\\\n### Gateway IP 를 도메인으로 변경 \n\n\n:::tip\nGateway IP 를 사전에 설정한 상태에서 진행하세요.  \n\n:::\n\n\\\n#### MariaDB 에 접속합니다. \n\n```sql\n# mysql -u root -p DB_PGZT\nEnter password: \n```\n\n\\\n#### 아래 쿼리를 수행하여 변경할 값을 확인합니다. \n\n```sql\nMariaDB [DB_PGZT]> \nSELECT\r\n  A.SGW_TUNL_IP,       # IPSec VPN IP\r\n  A.SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP   # SSL VPN IP\r\nFROM TB_CORE_GW A;\n+-------------+------------------+\r\n| SGW_TUNL_IP | SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP |\r\n+-------------+------------------+\r\n|             | 172.31.151.239   |\r\n+-------------+------------------+\r\n1 row in set (0.000 sec) \n```\n\n\\\n#### 업데이트를 수행합니다. \n\n```sql\nMariaDB [DB_PGZT]> UPDATE TB_CORE_GW A SET A.SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP = '[DOMAIN]';\n```\n\n\\\n#### 네트워크 경계가 여러 개 일 경우 아래 쿼리를 참고합니다. \n\n```sql\nMariaDB [DB_PGZT]> \nSELECT\r\n  A.SPRMT_NM,  \r\n  B.SGW_TUNL_IP,       # IPSec VPN IP\r\n  B.SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP   # SSL VPN IP\nFROM TB_PRMT A JOIN TB_CORE_GW B\n  ON A.SCORE_INFR_MSTR_ID = B.SINFR_MSTR_ID;\n +---------------------+-------------+------------------+\r\n| SPRMT_NM            | SGW_TUNL_IP | SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP |\r\n+---------------------+-------------+------------------+\r\n| network-perimeter#1 |             | 172.31.151.239   |\r\n+---------------------+-------------+------------------+\r\n1 row in set (0.000 sec) \n```\n\n\\\n#### 업데이트를 수행합니다. \n\n```sql\nMariaDB [DB_PGZT]> \nUPDATE \n  TB_PRMT A JOIN TB_CORE_GW B \n  ON A.SCORE_INFR_MSTR_ID = B.SINFR_MSTR_ID \nSET \n  B.SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP = '[DOMAIN]' \nWHERE \n  A.SPRMT_NM = 'network-perimeter#1'; \n```\n\n\\\n#### 트랜잭션 사용하여 안전하게 변경 \n\n```sql\nMariaDB [DB_PGZT]> START TRANSACTION;\n\nMariaDB [DB_PGZT]> UPDATE TB_PRMT A JOIN TB_CORE_GW B\n  ON A.SCORE_INFR_MSTR_ID = B.SINFR_MSTR_ID \nSET \n  B.SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP = '[DOMAIN]' \nWHERE \n  A.SPRMT_NM = 'network-perimeter#1';\n\n-- 결과 확인\nSELECT \n  A.SPRMT_NM, B.SOVPN_GW_TUNL_IP \nFROM TB_PRMT A JOIN TB_CORE_GW B ON A.SCORE_INFR_MSTR_ID = B.SINFR_MSTR_ID\nWHERE \n  A.SPRMT_NM = 'network-perimeter#1';\n\n-- 문제없으면 COMMIT, 문제있으면 ROLLBACK\nCOMMIT;  -- 또는 ROLLBACK;\n```\n\n\\\n\n---\n\n\\\n	2026-02-13 02:10:49.963+00	2026-03-15 10:21:12.191+00	8950f151-a83b-4c35-a061-cee0bc45d06c	e4e3b31f-640c-4d68-b73e-59ddb0785bc5	4c41bfa6-6811-4e25-b37c-4c24f0121cc8	97bb95f8-3ffa-44aa-b51b-dfd5430f3524	4	'0.000':105B,188B '1':101B,182B,184B,225B,268B,301B '172.31.151.239':100B,183B 'a.score':163B,206B,249B,288B 'a.sgw':75B 'a.sovpn':81B,119B 'a.sprmt':138B,220B,263B,272B,296B 'b':161B,204B,247B,286B 'b.sgw':140B 'b.sinfr':167B,210B,253B,292B 'b.sovpn':146B,214B,257B,274B 'commit':303B,306B 'control':16B,32B 'core':90B,115B,159B,202B,245B,284B 'db':60B,72B,111B,135B,194B,232B,237B 'db에':34B 'domain':123B,218B,261B 'enter':62B 'gateway':1A,6C,10C,17B,39B,45B 'gw':82B,91B,97B,116B,120B,147B,160B,176B,203B,215B,246B,258B,275B,285B 'id':166B,169B,209B,212B,252B,255B,291B,294B 'info':14B 'infr':164B,207B,250B,289B 'ip':2A,7C,11C,24B,40B,46B,77B,80B,84B,87B,95B,99B,122B,142B,145B,149B,152B,174B,178B,217B,260B,277B 'ipsec':78B,143B 'join':157B,200B,243B,282B 'mariadb':52B,71B,110B,134B,193B,231B,236B 'mstr':165B,168B,208B,211B,251B,254B,290B,293B 'mysql':56B 'ndomain':27B 'network':180B,223B,266B,299B 'network-perimet':179B,222B,265B,298B 'nm':139B,171B,221B,264B,273B,297B 'p':59B 'password':63B 'perimet':181B,224B,267B,300B 'pgzt':61B,73B,112B,136B,195B,233B,238B 'prmt':155B,198B,241B,280B 'rollback':305B,308B 'root':58B 'row':102B,185B 'sec':106B,189B 'select':74B,137B,271B 'set':104B,118B,187B,213B,256B 'sgw':93B,172B 'sovpn':96B,175B 'sprmt':170B 'sql':55B,70B,109B,133B,192B,230B 'ssl':85B,150B 'start':234B 'tb':89B,114B,154B,158B,197B,201B,240B,244B,279B,283B 'tip':44B 'transact':235B 'tunl':76B,83B,94B,98B,121B,141B,148B,173B,177B,216B,259B,276B 'u':57B 'updat':113B,196B,239B 'vpn':