f82c9f97-617f-4134-8dec-7496f6e7afa7	A1AfXCoYhr	Windows 다중 인터페이스 확인 PS 스크립트	\\\n\\\n### 설정 확인 스크립트 (Windows) \n\n단말에서 Power shell으로 아래 명령을 실행하면 기준에 부합하는 인터페이스를 확인할 수 있습니다.\n\n```powershell\nGet-WmiObject Win32_NetworkAdapter | Where-Object {\r\n    $._PhysicalAdapter -eq $true -and\r\n    $._NetEnabled -eq $true -and\r\n    $._NetConnectionStatus -in 1,2 -and\r\n    $._Name -notmatch '(?i)virtual|vm'\r\n} | Select Name, InterfaceIndex, MACAddress, NetEnabled, NetConnectionStatus\n```\n\n\\\n\\\n### 참고 이슈 \n\n* <https://pribit.atlassian.net/browse/ITSQA-210>\n\n\\\n\\\n	2026-04-17 06:16:19.522+00	2026-04-17 06:17:54.245+00	8950f151-a83b-4c35-a061-cee0bc45d06c	e4e3b31f-640c-4d68-b73e-59ddb0785bc5	76accd9c-e2b9-4370-b8f6-f444daa190be	97bb95f8-3ffa-44aa-b51b-dfd5430f3524	2	'/browse/itsqa-210':60B '1':42B '2':43B 'eq':33B,37B 'get':25B 'get-wmiobject':24B 'interfaceindex':52B 'macaddress':53B 'name':45B,51B 'netconnectionstatus':40B,55B 'neten':36B,54B 'networkadapt':28B 'notmatch':46B 'object':31B 'physicaladapt':32B 'power':12B 'powershel':23B 'pribit.atlassian.net':59B 'pribit.atlassian.net/browse/itsqa-210':58B 'ps':5A 'select':50B 'shell으로':13B 'true':34B,38B 'virtual':48B 'vm':49B 'where-object':29B 'win32':27B 'window':1A,10B 'wmiobject':26B '기준에':17B '다중':2A '단말에서':11B '명령을':15B '부합하는':18B '설정':7B '수':21B '스크립트':6A,9B '실행하면':16B '아래':14B '이슈':57B '인터페이스':3A '인터페이스를':19B '있습니다':22B '참고':56B '확인':4A,8B '확인할':20B	\N	97bb95f8-3ffa-44aa-b51b-dfd5430f3524	{97bb95f8-3ffa-44aa-b51b-dfd5430f3524}	\N	2026-04-17 06:16:34.85+00	\N	\N	f	12.0.0	2	f	\N	\N	\\	f	\N	t
