285d782e-596c-4823-a0ff-3f5ee0735267	Gateway	💡본 문서는 PRIBIT Connect Gateway(이하 'PCG')의 단계별 설치 방법을 안내합니다. \n\n설치 버전 : `2.6.4.0` \\~ \n\n\n---\n\n**TOC (Table Of Contents)** \n\n* [Gateway Modules](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-gateway-modules) \n* [Installation Steps](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-installation-steps)\n  * [PCG Package 압축 해제](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-pcg-package-압축-해제) \n  * [PCG 설치](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-pcg-설치) \n    * [설치 스크립트 start-wizard.sh 실행](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-설치-스크립트-start-wizardsh-실행) \n    * [PCG 가 사용할 in-memory Database(Redis)를 설치](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-pcg-가-사용할-in-memory-databaseredis를-설치) \n  * [PCG Process / Port 확인](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-pcg-process-확인) \n* [Upgrade](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/gateway-r8ggRJnAyC#h-upgrade) \n\n\n---\n\n## **Gateway Modules**   \n\n* OpenVPN (connect-vpn) \n* IPSec (StrongSwan)\n* Nginx (Web Server) \n* Gateway Web (connect-gateway)\n* Redis \n\n\n---\n\n## Installation Steps\n\n### **PCG Package 압축 해제**\n\n* 설치를 진행 할 계정을 root 로 변경해줍니다.\n* 설치 시작 위치에 패키지 파일을 준비해 놓습니다.\n* deb로 압축된 패키지를 지정된 디렉토리에 압축 해제하는 과정입니다.\n\n\\\n`dpkg` 명령어를 실행하여 패키지를 설치합니다.\n\n```none\n# dpkg -i PRIBIT-Connect-Gateway_[VERSION].deb\n\nSelecting previously unselected package pribit-connect-gateway.\n(Reading database ... 108777 files and directories currently installed.)\nPreparing to unpack PRIBIT-Connect-Gateway_2.6.4.0.deb ...\nUnpacking pribit-connect-gateway (2.6.4.0) ...\nSetting up pribit-connect-gateway (2.6.4.0) ...\n```\n\n\\\n`deb` 패키지를 설치하면 `/usr/local/pribit/wizard/` 경로에 다음과 같은 파일이 생성됩니다.\n\n```none\n# cd /usr/local/pribit/wizard\n# ls -al\ndrwxrwxr-x  5 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 12 06:27 .\ndrwxrwxr-x  3 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 12 06:27 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 pribit pribit 20480 Aug 12 06:27 archives\ndrwxrwxr-x 10 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 12 06:27 default-config\ndrwxrwxr-x  4 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 12 06:27 src-compile\n-rwxrwxr-x  1 pribit pribit 42421 Jun 12 04:44 start-wizard.sh\n```\n\n\\\n### **PCG 설치**\n\n* PCG 설치는 `start-wizard.sh` 스크립트를 실행하여 설치를 진행합니다.\n* 설치 방식은 다음 두 가지가 있습니다.\n* Offline 설치 방식 : `start-wizard.sh --off_line`\n  * 인터넷 네트워크와 연결이 없는 Offline 으로 설치를 진행합니다.\n* Online 설치 방식 : `start-wizard.sh`\n  * 인터넷 네트워크와 연결된 Online 으로 설치를 진행합니다.\n\n#### 설치 스크립트 start-wizard.sh 실행\n\n```none\n# ./start-wizard.sh \n```\n\n`./start-wizard.sh` 명령어를 실행합니다.\n\n\n:::info\n인터넷(외부 네트워크)이 연결된 환경에서 실행해야 합니다.\n\n:::\n\n\\\n#### PCG 가 사용할 in-memory Database(Redis)를 설치\n\n```none\n========================================================================================= \nEnter in-memory DB new AUTH:  [패스워드 입력]\nRe-enter in-memory DB new AUTH: [패스워드 재입력]\n```\n\nin-momory Database(Redis) 의 패스워드를 입력합니다.\n\n*(Redis 패스워드 ==Pribit2560!==)*\n\n\\\n```none\n=========================================================================================\nremove unused package\nReading package lists... Done\nBuilding dependency tree       \nReading state information... Done\nPackage 'tftpd-hpa' is not installed, so not removed\n\n... \n(중략)\n...\n\n[2025-08-12T07:24:44,868] [main] INFO GatewayUtil -- createResourceFile path : /var/connect/gateway/system-integrity/inmemorydb.pgd\n=========================================================================================\nfnRedisSetting\n=========================================================================================\nRemoved /etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/redis-server.service.\nRemoved /etc/systemd/system/redis.service.\nCreated symlink /etc/systemd/system/redis.service → /etc/systemd/system/redis-server.service.\nCreated symlink /etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/redis-server.service → /etc/systemd/system/redis-server.service.\n=========================================================================================\nfnRedisSetting is complete\n=========================================================================================\n```\n\nPCG 실행에 필요한 라이브러리 및 모듈을 설치합니다. \n\n*(전체 설치 로그)*\n\n\\\n설치가 완료되면 *'==PacketGo Gateway Install was completed.=='* 라는 메시지가 나타나며, 설치 과정이 완료됩니다. \n\n```none\n========================================================\n        PacketGo Gateway Install was completed.\nOpenSSL has been updated. A system reboot is required.\n========================================================\n```\n\n\\\n\n:::warning\n설치 완료 이후 시스템 Reboot 이 필요 합니다.\n\n:::\n\n\\\n다음을 입력하여 시스템을 reboot 합니다. \n\n```none\n# reboot\n```\n\n\\\n### **PCG Process / Port 확인**\n\n설치가 정상적으로 완료되면 PCG 가 자동으로 실행되도록 되어 있습니다. \n\n모든 모듈이 정상적으로 기동되었는지 확인합니다. \n\n\\\n* **Gateway Package Process 확인** \n  * VPN / IPSec\n    * connect-vpn \n    * ipsec starter (Strongswan-starter)\n    * ipsec charon \n\n  ```none\n  root@packetgo-gateway:~# ps -ef | grep -E 'connect-vpn'\\|'ipsec'\r\n  root         896       1  0 Feb09 ?        00:00:00 /usr/local/libexec/ipsec/starter --daemon charon --nofork\r\n  root         904     896  0 Feb09 ?        00:00:00 /usr/local/libexec/ipsec/charon\r\n  root       12257       1  0 Feb09 ?        00:00:49 /var/connect/connect-vpn/connect-vpn --config /var/connect/connect-vpn/conf/server.conf --disable-dco\n  ```\n\n  \\\n  * WEB / WAS\n    * nginx \n    * gateway check \n    * gateway rpc-server \n\n  ```none\n  # ps -ef | grep gateway \n  root     2793526       1  3 14:39 ?        00:00:21 /usr/bin/java -Djdk.lang.Process.launchMechanism=vfork -Duser.timezone=Asia/Seoul -jar /var/connect/gateway/check/gateway-check-1.0.jar\n  root     2793627       1  4 14:39 ?        00:00:23 /usr/bin/java -server -Dconnect=pribit-gateway -Dconnect.home=/var/connect/gateway -Dfile.encoding=utf8 -Djdk.lang.Process.launchMechanism=vfork -Xms1048m -Xmx1048m -Duser.timezone=Asia/Seoul -jar /var/connect/gateway/rpc/gateway-rpc-server-1.0.jar\n  ```\n\n  \\\n  * In-Memory Database (Redis)\n\n  ```none\n  # ps -ef | grep redis\n  redis     199607       1  0 16:25 ?        00:00:09 /usr/bin/redis-server 127.0.0.1:6379\n  ```\n\n  \\\n* **Gateway Package Listen Port 확인** \n  * `TCP PORT 443`: connect-vpn \n  * `TCP PORT 5995`: nginx \n  * `TCP PORT 5996`: nginx \n  * `UDP PORT 500`: charon \n  * `UDP PORT 4500`: charon \n  * `TCP PORT 9093`: gateway rpc-server \n  * `TCP PORT 6379`: redis-server \n\n```none\n# netstat -anlp | grep -E 'connect-vpn'\\|'charon'\\|'starter'\\|'nginx'\\|'java'\\|'redis-server'\r\ntcp        0      0 0.0.0.0:443             0.0.0.0:*               LISTEN      12257/connect-vpn\r\ntcp        0      0 0.0.0.0:5995            0.0.0.0:*               LISTEN      938/nginx: master p\r\ntcp        0      0 0.0.0.0:5996            0.0.0.0:*               LISTEN      938/nginx: master p\r\ntcp        0      0 127.0.0.1:6379          0.0.0.0:*               LISTEN      798/redis-server 12\r\ntcp        0      0 127.0.0.1:6379          127.0.0.1:12080         ESTABLISHED 798/redis-server 12\r\ntcp        0      0 127.0.0.1:6379          127.0.0.1:55398         ESTABLISHED 798/redis-server 12\r\ntcp6       0      0 :::9093                 :::*                    LISTEN      531/java\r\ntcp6       0      0 127.0.0.1:12080         127.0.0.1:6379          ESTABLISHED 529/java\r\ntcp6       0      0 127.0.0.1:55398         127.0.0.1:6379          ESTABLISHED 531/java\r\nudp        0      0 0.0.0.0:4500            0.0.0.0:*                           904/charon\r\nudp        0      0 10.20.0.1:68            10.20.0.255:67          ESTABLISHED 904/charon\r\nudp        0      0 0.0.0.0:500             0.0.0.0:*                           904/charon\r\nudp6       0      0 :::4500                 :::*                                904/charon\r\nudp6       0      0 :::500                  :::*                                904/charon\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7706     938/nginx: master p\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7554     798/redis-server 12\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7703     938/nginx: master p\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7702     938/nginx: master p\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7705     938/nginx: master p\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7707     938/nginx: master p\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     8723     896/starter\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     6434     531/java\r\nunix  2      [ ]         DGRAM      CONNECTED     6072     896/starter\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7704     938/nginx: master p\r\nunix  2      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     5806     531/java\r\nunix  2      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     5090     529/java\r\nunix  2      [ ACC ]     STREAM     LISTENING     9229     904/charon           /var/run/charon.ctl\r\nunix  2      [ ACC ]     STREAM     LISTENING     9230     904/charon           /var/run/charon.vici\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     6413     529/java\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7710     938/nginx: master p\r\nunix  3      [ ]         STREAM     CONNECTED     7711     938/nginx: master p\r\n```\n\n\\\n#### **초기 설정** \n\n* PCG 가 정상적으로 기동되면 관리자 PC 에서 PCC Console 에 접속하여 Gateway를 등록합니다.\n* 초기 설정(사용자 메뉴얼) 관련 페이지를 참고하세요.\n\n\\\n### **Upgrade** \n\n* Gateway 업그레이드 시 [Upgrade](/doc/upgrade-72KcV6sazP) 문서를 참고하세요. \n\n\\\n	2026-02-11 06:44:10.681+00	2026-02-11 06:49:10.792+00	97bb95f8-3ffa-44aa-b51b-dfd5430f3524	51ad90bc-f7f5-4a00-b201-5a74ac473705	12.0.0	2	\N
c6b9febd-49ff-4c7f-a7f1-0f9d5976d0e8	Controller	💡본 문서는 PRIBIT Connect Controller(이하 'PCC')의 단계별 설치 방법을 안내합니다. \n\n설치 버전 : `2.6.4.x ~` \n\n\n---\n\n**TOC (Table Of Contents)** \n\n* [Controller Modues](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-controller-modules) \n* [Installation Steps](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-installation-steps) \n  * [PCC Package 압축 해제](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-pcc-package-압축-해제) \n  * [PCC 설치](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-pcc-설치) \n    * [설치 스크립트 install_offline.sh 실행](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-설치-스크립트-installofflinesh-실행) \n    * [PCC 가 사용할 Database 설치](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-pcc-가-사용할-database-설치) \n    * [PCC Console 에 접근 허용할 IP Address 설정](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-pcc-console-에-접근-허용할-ip-address-설정) \n    * [PCC 에서 사용하는 라이브러리 설치](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-pcc-에서-사용하는-라이브러리-설치) \n    * [PCC 설치 마무리](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-pcc-설치-마무리) \n  * [PCC Process 확인](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-pcc-process-확인) \n  * [초기 설정 및 라이선스 적용](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-초기-설정-및-라이선스-적용) \n* [설치 스크립트 기준 패키지 프로세스](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-설치-스크립트-기준-패키지-프로세스) \n  * [설치하는 프로세스, 라이브러리 리스트](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-설치하는-프로세스-라이브러리-리스트) \n  * [실행시키는 프로그램 리스트](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-실행시키는-프로그램-리스트) \n* [Upgrade](https://doc.tech-packetgo.com/doc/controller-wAf4siO4EI#h-upgrade) \n\n\n---\n\n## **Controller Modules** \n\n* Nginx (Web Server) \n* Controller-RPC (connect-controller) \n* Controller-Web (connect-controller-web) \n* Controller-API (connect-controller-api) \n* Controller-Check (connect-controller-check) \n* MariaDB(Meta Database) \n* Redis \n\n\n---\n\n## Installation Steps \n\n### PCC Package 압축 해제 \n\n* 설치를 진행 할 계정을 root 로 변경해줍니다. \n* 설치 시작 위치에 패키지 파일을 준비해 놓습니다. \n* deb로 압축된 패키지를 지정된 디렉토리에 압축 해제하는 과정입니다. \n\n\\\n`dpkg` 명령어를 실행하여 패키지를 설치합니다. \n\n```none\n# dpkg -i PRIBIT-Connect-Controller-Focal_[VERSION].deb\n\nSelecting previously unselected package pribit-connect-controller.\n(Reading database ... 145175 files and directories currently installed.)\nPreparing to unpack PRIBIT-Connect-Controller-Focal_[VERSION].deb ...\nUnpacking pribit-connect-controller ([VERSION]) ...\nSetting up pribit-connect-controller ([VERSION]) ...\n```\n\n\\\n`deb` 패키지를 설치하면 `/usr./local/pribit/connect/service/` 경로에 다음과 같은 파일이 생성됩니다. \n\n```none\n# cd /usr/local/pribit/connect/services\n# ls -al\ndrwxrwxr-x  7 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 11 08:06 .\ndrwxrwxr-x  3 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 11 08:06 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 11 08:06 ctrl\n-rwxrwxr-x  1 pribit pribit 59473 Aug  5 06:27 install_offline.sh\n-rwxrwxr-x  1 pribit pribit 62237 Aug  5 06:27 install_online.sh\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 11 08:06 mysql\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 11 08:06 nginx\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 11 08:06 sys\ndrwxrwxr-x 23 pribit pribit  4096 Aug 11 08:06 thirdparty-packages\n```\n\n\\\n### PCC 설치 \n\n* PCC 설치 방식에는 `install_offline.sh`와 `install_online.sh` 두 가지 옵션이 있습니다. \n* `install_offline.sh` 설치 방식 \n  * 인터넷 네트워크와 연결이 없는 `install_Offline.sh` 스크립트로 설치를 진행합니다. \n* `install_online.sh` 설치 방식 \n  * 인터넷 네트워크와 연결된 `intall_online.sh` 스크립트로 설치를 진행합니다. \n\n\\\n#### 설치 스크립트 install_offline.sh 실행 \n\n`./install_offline.sh` 명령어를 실행합니다. \n\n```none\n# ./install_offline.sh \n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | Installing PRIBIT Connect Controller\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | The installation process is saved in a log file\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | log file path '/opt/connect/logs/connect-controller-install.log'\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | This OS is Ubuntu 20.04.6 LTS\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | OS Auto Update Disable Setting\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | modify /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/10periodic\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | modify /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/20auto-upgrades\n2025-08-11 08:24:00 | disable apt-daily.timer\n2025-08-11 08:24:01 | disable apt-daily-upgrade.timer\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-11 08:24:01 | OS Auto Update Disable Setting SUCCESS\n=========================================================================================\n(Continue)\n```\n\n\\\n#### PCC 가 사용할 Database 설치 \n\nDatabase 의 root 계정 패스워드를 입력합니다. \n\n```none\nEnter DBMS root new password: [패스워드 입력]\nRe-enter DBMS root new password: [패스워드 재입력]\n=========================================================================================\n(Continue)\n```\n\n*(root 계정 패스워드 Rapi2560!)*\n\n\\\nDatabase User 를 생성하고 계정의 패스워드를 입력합니다.\n\n```none\nCreate database User : pribit\nEnter pribit new password: [패스워드 입력]\nRe-enter pribit new password: [패스워드 입력]\n(Continue)\n```\n\n*(계정: pribit / 패스워드: Rapi2560!)*\n\n\\\n#### PCC Console 에 접근 허용할 IP Address 설정 \n\n설치되는 PRIBIT Connect Controller 관리자 페이지에  접속 허용 할 IP Address 정보를 입력합니다. \n\n```none\n=========================================================================================\nEnter Allowed IP for PRIBIT Connect Controller : [접근 허용 IP Address]\nRe-enter Allowed IP for PRIBIT Connect Controller : [접근 허용 IP Address]\n(Continue)\n```\n\n*모두 허용 (All allow) 시: 0.0.0.0* \n\n*특정 관리자 허용 시: host 단위 ip 지정* \n\n\\\n#### PCC 에서 사용하는 라이브러리 설치 \n\nPCC 실행에 필요한 라이브러리들을 설치합니다. (자동 진행) \n\n```none\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 02:25:23 | apt-get update\n2025-08-12 02:25:23 | OFF-LINE mode do not need apt-get update\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 02:25:23 | net-tools install\n2025-08-12 02:25:23 | net-tools already installed.\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 02:25:23 | rdate install\n2025-08-12 02:25:29 | rdate installation                                     \n2025-08-12 02:25:29 | rdate install SUCCESS\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 11:25:30 | timezone is 'Asia/Seoul'\n2025-08-12 11:25:30 | time server is 'time.bora.net'\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 11:25:30 | rsyslog setting\n2025-08-12 11:25:31 | rsyslog setting SUCCESS\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 11:25:31 | check service\n2025-08-12 11:25:31 | check service SUCCESS\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 11:25:32 | openjdk-17-jre install\n2025-08-12 11:26:22 | openjdk-17-jre installation                                     \n2025-08-12 11:26:22 | openjdk-17-jre install SUCCESS\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 11:26:22 | build-essential install\n2025-08-12 11:27:16 | build-essential installation                                     \n2025-08-12 11:27:16 | build-essential install SUCCESS\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 11:27:16 | libpcre3-dev install\n2025-08-12 11:27:26 | libpcre3-dev installation                                     \n2025-08-12 11:27:26 | libpcre3-dev install SUCCESS\n=========================================================================================\n2025-08-12 11:27:26 | zlib1g-dev install\n2025-08-12 11:27:32 | zlib1g-dev installa