f8031f5f-8fe0-4c18-811f-46dee1207482	사설 인증서 생성(Self-signed)	### 1. Root CA 인증서 생성\n\n#### 1.1 RSA 키 생성\n\n```none\nroot@pribit:/opt/cert# openssl genrsa -aes256 -out pribit-rootca.key 2048\nEnter PEM pass phrase: (Pribit2560!) \nVerifying - Enter PEM pass phrase: (Pribit2560!)\n```\n\n AES-256 암호화 알고리즘을 사용하여 pribit-rootca.key 라는 개인키를 생성하는 방법입니다. \\n생성 시, 비밀 번호를 숙지하고 있어야 합니다. (이후, 생성할 때 계속 사용함) \n\n\\\n#### 1.2 권한 변경\n\n```none\nroot@pribit:/opt/cert# ls -al pribit-rootca.key\r\n-rw------- 1 root root 1874 Feb 26 04:18 pribit-rootca.key\r\nroot@pribit:/opt/cert# chmod 600 pribit-rootca.key \n```\n\n 개인 이외의 그룹 및 기타에 대한 접근 권한을 모두 제거합니다. (key 생성 시, 600 이 아닌 경우가 있음) \n\n\\\n#### 1.3 설정 파일 생성 및 설정 (.conf) \n\n```none\nroot@pribit:/opt/cert# cat rootca_openssl.conf \n[ req ]\ndefault_bits            = 2048\ndefault_md              = sha1\ndefault_keyfile         = pribit-rootca.key\ndistinguished_name      = req_distinguished_name\nextensions              = v3_ca\nreq_extensions          = v3_ca\n\n[ v3_ca ]\nbasicConstraints       = critical, CA:TRUE, pathlen:0\nsubjectKeyIdentifier   = hash\n##authorityKeyIdentifier = keyid:always, issuer:always\nkeyUsage               = keyCertSign, cRLSign\nnsCertType             = sslCA, emailCA, objCA\n[req_distinguished_name ]\ncountryName                     = Country Name (2 letter code)\ncountryName_default             = KR\ncountryName_min                 = 2\ncountryName_max                 = 2\n\n# 회사명 입력\norganizationName              = PRIBIT .Corp\norganizationName_default      = PRIBIT .Corp\n\n# 부서 입력\n#organizationalUnitName          = Organizational Unit Name (eg, section)\n#organizationalUnitName_default  = Condor Project\n\n# SSL 서비스할 domain 명 입력\ncommonName                      = Common Name (eg, your name or your server's hostname)\ncommonName_default              = doc.tech-packetgo.com\ncommonName_max                  = 64\n```\n\n\\\n#### 1.4 csr 파일 생성 및 확인 \n\n```none\nroot@pribit:/opt/cert# openssl req -new -key pribit-rootca.key -out pribit-rootca.csr -config rootca_openssl.conf\r\nEnter pass phrase for pribit-rootca.key:\r\nYou are about to be asked to enter information that will be incorporated\r\ninto your certificate request.\r\nWhat you are about to enter is what is called a Distinguished Name or a DN.\r\nThere are quite a few fields but you can leave some blank\r\nFor some fields there will be a default value,\r\nIf you enter '.', the field will be left blank.\r\n-----\r\nCountry Name (2 letter code) [KR]:\r\nPRIBIT .Corp [PRIBIT .Corp]:\r\nCommon Name (eg, your name or your servers hostname) [*.tech-packetgo.com]:\n```\n\n\\\n생성된 `pribit-rootca.csr` \n\n```none\nroot@pribit:/opt/cert# openssl req -text -in pribit-rootca.csr\nCertificate Request:\n    Data:\n        Version: 1 (0x0)\n        Subject: C = KR, O = PRIBIT .Corp, CN = *.tech-packetgo.com\n        Subject Public Key Info:\n            Public Key Algorithm: rsaEncryption\n                Public-Key: (2048 bit)\n                Modulus:\n                    00:a4:40:b1:3e:65:28:3e:c9:20:f9:9f:4b:de:16:\n                    ... \n                    2a:9d:e4:d1:fd:69:a9:7e:da:74:e7:8d:78:92:eb:\n                    f8:85\n                Exponent: 65537 (0x10001)\n        Attributes:\n            Requested Extensions:\n                X509v3 Basic Constraints: critical\n                    CA:TRUE, pathlen:0\n                X509v3 Subject Key Identifier:\n                    78:38:2A:B3:FA:98:BE:82:4D:8C:C6:C7:06:0E:8D:3D:DC:88:3C:7B\n                X509v3 Key Usage:\n                    Certificate Sign, CRL Sign\n                Netscape Cert Type:\n                    SSL CA, S/MIME CA, Object Signing CA\n    Signature Algorithm: sha1WithRSAEncryption\n    Signature Value:\n        60:ea:11:f8:99:26:6d:79:df:8f:08:04:65:c9:20:65:13:75:\n        ... \n        f5:74:90:bb\n-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE REQUEST-----\nMIIC6zCCAdMCAQAwQjELMAkGA1UEBhMCS1IxFTATBgNVBAoMDFBSSUJJVCAuQ29y\n...\nO9d7Qwvrm0zdEitc4VAdDuT1KDd580UQzk0U9XSQuw==\n-----END CERTIFICATE REQUEST-----\n```\n\n\\\n#### 1.5 Self Signed 인증서 생성 및 확인 (crt File) \n\n\\\n```none\nroot@pribit:/opt/cert# openssl x509 -req -days 1825 -extensions v3_ca -set_serial 1 -in pribit-rootca.csr -signkey pribit-rootca.key -out pribit-rootca.crt -extfile rootca_openssl.conf\nEnter pass phrase for pribit-rootca.key:\nCertificate request self-signature ok\nsubject=C = KR, O = PRIBIT .Corp, CN = *.tech-packetgo.com\n```\n\n\\\n\\\n	2026-02-26 04:32:51.667+00	2026-02-26 04:37:51.708+00	97bb95f8-3ffa-44aa-b51b-dfd5430f3524	1849cd17-4fb8-48ca-b576-4c75902bbb10	12.0.0	2	\N
