5cfc05ce-dfa7-4c83-916d-92d0db639f48	HA/REPLICATION 설정	\\\n## **\\[CONTROLLER\\]** \n\n\n:::info\nController #1 실행 명령어 → Controller #2 번의 접속 정보를 입력 \n\nController #2 실행 명령어 → Controller #1 번의 접속 정보를 입력 \n\n:::\n\n\\\n### **HA 설정**  \n\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar `arg1` `arg2` `arg3` `arg4` `arg5` `arg6` `arg7`  `arg8` `arg9`\n\n\\\n* `arg1`  고정값 ‘ha’ \n* `arg2`  Server#1 \n* `arg3`  Server#2 \n* `arg4`  VIP \n* `arg5`  Router ID \n  * Router 아이디는 마스터/백업 동일한 아이디로 설정 \n* `arg6`  SSH Port \n* `arg7`  User Password (==pribit==) \n* `arg8`  DB root Password (==root==) \n* `arg9`  Command \n  * MASTER / BACKUP \n\n\\\n**Controller #1 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar ha 10.1.31.120 10.1.31.121 10.1.31.119 10 22016 Packetgo2560! Pribit2560! MASTER\n```\n\n\\\n**Controller #2 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar ha 10.1.31.120 10.1.31.121 10.1.31.119 10 22016 Packetgo2560! Pribit2560! BACKUP\n```\n\n\\\n### **INIT 설정 수행 (Replication 설정)**\n\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar `arg1` `arg2` `arg3` `arg4` `arg5` `arg6` `arg7`  `arg8` \n\n\\\n* `arg1`  고정값 ‘ha’ \n* `arg2`  Server#1 \n* `arg3`  Server#2 \n* `arg4`  VIP \n* `arg5`  SSH Port \n* `arg6`  User Password (==pribit==) \n* `arg7`  DB root Password (==root==) \n* `arg8`  Command \n  * MINIT / SINIT \n\n\\\n**Controller #1 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar ha 192.168.91.117 192.168.91.118 192.168.91.140 22 Packetgo2560! Pribit2560! MINIT\n```\n\n\\\n**Controller #2 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar ha 192.168.91.117 192.168.91.118 192.168.91.140 22 Packetgo2560! Pribit2560! SINIT\n```\n\n\\\n### **DB Replication 재설정** \n\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar `arg1` `arg2` `arg3` `arg4` `arg5` `arg6` `arg7`  `arg8` \n\n\\\n* `arg1`  고정값 ‘ha’ \n* `arg2`  Server#1 \n* `arg3`  Server#2 \n* `arg4`  VIP \n* `arg5`  SSH Port  \n* `arg6`  User Password (==pribit==) \n* `arg7`  DB root Password (==root==) \n* `arg8`  Command \n  * MREPLI / SREPLI \n\n\\\n**Controller #1 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar ha 192.168.91.117 192.168.91.118 192.168.91.140 22 Packetgo2560! Pribit2560! MREPLI\n```\n\n\\\n**Controller #2 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar ha 192.168.91.117 192.168.91.118 192.168.91.140 22 Packetgo2560! Pribit2560! SREPLI \n```\n\n\\\n### Replication 확인 \n\nController #2 호기에서 다음 상태를 확인합니다. \n\n```sql\nMariaDB [(none)]> show slave status\\G;\n*************************** 1. row ***************************\n                            ...\n              Slave_IO_Running: Yes\n             Slave_SQL_Running: Yes\n                            ...\n```\n\n* Slave_IO_Running: Yes \n* Slave_SQL_Running: Yes \n\n\\\n\n---\n\n## \\[GATEWAY\\] \n\n\n:::info\nGateway 는 DB 가 없기 때문에 HA 설정만 진행합니다. \n\n:::\n\n\\\n### HA 설정 \n\njava -jar /opt/connect/controller/util/controller-util-1.0.jar `arg1` `arg2` `arg3` `arg4` `arg5` `arg6` `arg7`  \n\n\\\n* `arg1`  고정값 ‘ha’ \n* `arg2`  구성 \n  * onearm / inline  \n* `arg3`  Server#1 \n* `arg4`  Server#2 \n* `arg5`  VIP   \n* `arg6`  VIP Router ID \n  * Router 아이디는 마스터/백업 동일한 아이디로 설정 \n* `arg7`  Command \n  * MASTER / BACKUP \n\n\\\n**Gateway #1 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /var/connect/gateway/util/gateway-util-1.0.jar ha onearm 192.168.91.115 192.168.91.116 192.168.91.141 20 MASTER\n```\n\n\\\n**Gateway #2 호기** \n\n```bash\njava -jar /var/connect/gateway/util/gateway-util-1.0.jar ha onearm 192.168.91.115 192.168.91.116 192.168.91.141 20 BACKUP\n```\n\n\\\n\n---\n\n## Keepalived \n\n\\\nkeepalived 모듈 상태 확인 \n\n```bash\n$ systemctl status keepalived \n```\n\n\\\n	2026-03-20 04:22:09.864+00	2026-03-20 04:27:09.916+00	97bb95f8-3ffa-44aa-b51b-dfd5430f3524	d33007e3-3d9e-40b4-83f5-635cc3a48e6a	12.0.0	2	\N
